 * Linear Elastic Fracture Mechanics (LEFM)
 *  - K_I = Y(a/W) * sigma * sqrt(pi * a)
 *  - a_c = (1/pi) * (K_IC / (Y * sigma))^2
 *  - Paris law: da/dN = C * (deltaK)^m
